{"time": 1753426689, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1049083960", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1021980440]总之四处闲逛，就当郊游了"}
{"time": 1753426736, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1874006222", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1066309839]“嗯哼，不过比起神社，好像已经变成猎场了”夏弥路过营地，沿着小坡向下“好像刚刚还有猎人经过？这还有脚印”"}
{"time": 1753426954, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2013474731", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嘛，毕竟废弃了之后，这片地方就还给自然了。\"指着往山上的路，\"走这边吧，我们去那边的建筑群看看。\""}
{"time": 1753426957, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1904353456", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(这地我熟)"}
