{"time": 1753434177, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1372781186", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“哎哎，夸张的家伙明明是你们吧”夏弥叹了口气“从这里出发的话，到火山应该也就半个小时？”"}
{"time": 1753434248, "type": "recv", "message_id": "329238200", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"怎么了？\"从身侧抱住她，\"明明都是夏弥让我出来的吧？\""}
{"time": 1753434412, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1896535318", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（准备出发，全程约216公里，预计时间30分钟（）"}
{"time": 1753434488, "type": "recv", "message_id": "596453157", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"现在当然带着我走啦。\"搂着她往神社外走"}
