{"time": 1753439094, "type": "recv", "message_id": "946524137", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(有点像)"}
{"time": 1753440180, "type": "recv", "message_id": "673159960", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1273144174]\"看来想要高过它的话还是有些困难。\"摊开工会的勘探地图，\"我看看...嗯...\"对照一下地图的地形和眼前看见的地形。"}
