{"time": 1753602564, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1367163817", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"这里居然设置好了营地吗？\"啧啧称奇，打量一下设置好的帐篷"}
{"time": 1753602582, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1076800742", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好贴心啊”"}
{"time": 1753602744, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1023724749", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "看起来久未有人用，上面落满了火山灰。里头依旧是简单的床铺，一旁的箱子里放着可能用得到的闪光弹5枚，异臭球5枚和冷饮若干"}
{"time": 1753602925, "type": "recv", "message_id": "325027032", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "除了一些长着大颚的爬虫外，没有别的生物造访的痕迹"}
{"time": 1753602951, "type": "recv", "message_id": "50695984", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"这就是补给品吗？\"把冷饮取出来分给众人，\"在火山的话，这个很有用。说起来，晚上的话确实不太适合测绘这样的工作。\""}
{"time": 1753602995, "type": "recv", "message_id": "405271881", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"不过，如果是找茬的话，现在似乎是最好的时间段。\""}
