{"time": 1753604739, "type": "recv", "message_id": "67676373", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“沧澜记得也要喝oh，这里很热的”嘱咐一下"}
{"time": 1753604869, "type": "recv", "message_id": "731450695", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1491833925]夏弥闭眼张嘴，淡蓝接近无色的液体在喉头往复间入腹。口味大体清甜，但总归压不住最关键的苦味"}
{"time": 1753604978, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1095623790", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好苦...可以加蜂蜜吗，安姐姐”"}
{"time": 1753605018, "type": "recv", "message_id": "32326884", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=67676373]“嗯……”她旋开盖子，仰头两口喝完，末了咂咂嘴“嗯……体内凉凉的，但不会不舒服……真神奇”"}
