{"time": 1753609503, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1620581473", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（7点继续吧）"}
{"time": 1753615251, "type": "recv", "message_id": "331912820", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=32398811]“嗯姆……”赫萝大概是为了让你闭嘴，从你手中拿过冷饮，同样两口喝掉，留一个瓶子在手里起起落落"}
{"time": 1753615340, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2046000965", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=101469958]（组织好了吗）"}
{"time": 1753615538, "type": "recv", "message_id": "33461994", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“那就走吧，这还差不多嘛。这边应该不会有其他人，就随赫萝发挥咯？”"}
{"time": 1753615555, "type": "recv", "message_id": "10119084", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“emmm，我也不太清楚，说实话，大概是从小到大的教育这样说的吧，越隐私的部位越不能让别人碰....除非关系比较好，比如夫妻之类的”"}
{"time": 1753615573, "type": "recv", "message_id": "865897698", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "摊开手里的初步勘测图，看看有没有前人留下的路线"}
{"time": 1753616002, "type": "recv", "message_id": "262716696", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=10119084]“听起来好麻烦，不想让人碰的话，全都不让碰不就好了。不过伴侣的话……”她想了想“我见过的主要相处方式，还是分享食物和一同巡视领地”"}
{"time": 1753616157, "type": "recv", "message_id": "683157850", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“没有一起生孩子吗”"}
{"time": 1753616211, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1990163463", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“...”听着身后两人的对话，不免有些脸红，“呃...”"}
{"time": 1753616337, "type": "recv", "message_id": "682654036", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=865897698]赫萝走在前面，身上吞吐着红赫的微光，帮你们探着前路，不过甬道并不算长"}
{"time": 1753616356, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1755246454", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=683157850]（有点变态）"}
{"time": 1753616369, "type": "recv", "message_id": "273890594", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=683157850]“那不是基础吗？”"}
