{"time": 1753627881, "type": "recv", "message_id": "879109230", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“大家小心”"}
{"time": 1753627932, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1592507368", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "闭上眼，\"碎龙哦，露儿。\""}
{"time": 1753627946, "type": "recv", "message_id": "851798853", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "伸手帮夏弥也遮住眼"}
{"time": 1753627956, "type": "recv", "message_id": "565740482", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯，收到”"}
{"time": 1753628012, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1588723681", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"那两只拳击手一样的前肢会附着爆炸黏菌，嘴巴里似乎也能吐出爆炸的黏菌，不小心沾到的话，要在爆炸之前剥掉啦。\""}
{"time": 1753628059, "type": "recv", "message_id": "742134396", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“谢谢安姐姐”"}
{"time": 1753628254, "type": "recv", "message_id": "407921121", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "小球扔出，你们彼此还相隔二十余米，强烈的白光盛放，光芒偃息后，碎龙并未乱了阵脚，而是闭上眼睛，右侧前肢带着凶悍的力量重锤地面，在旁边的岩浆湖上震起涟漪，身前的地面被黄绿色的黏菌，随后便是上位者充满戾气的咆哮"}
{"time": 1753628279, "type": "recv", "message_id": "624944744", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（这么聪明吗）"}
{"time": 1753628290, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2061779322", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（但是冷知识，闪光灯闭眼也没用（）"}
{"time": 1753628296, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1692680937", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "没有放开遮住夏弥眼睛的双手，睁开眼看看，\"哦...\""}
