{"time": 1753677165, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1156630070", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "而攻击的原主偏转体势，反向喷射，停了下来，居然只是甩了甩手腕"}
