{"time": 1753680069, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1794266600", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "金属巨剑从胸腹的伤口贯入，大概完全摧毁了碎龙的内脏"}
{"time": 1753680175, "type": "recv", "message_id": "477753251", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "碎龙的动作骤然停滞，垂死之际，还想再锤下一拳，终究是无望"}
