{"time": 1753680652, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1286271477", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "片刻之后，黏菌逐渐黯淡下去，变成惨淡的暗绿色。碎龙早已歪向一侧，没了生息"}
{"time": 1753680793, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1177903450", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...好像可以过去看看了。\"摊摊手，作为一点也没出力的人，在原地没有动"}
{"time": 1753681196, "type": "recv", "message_id": "192725471", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯”也没出什么力，还是算了"}
