{"time": 1753681719, "type": "recv", "message_id": "970309404", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"唔...真惨啊这家伙\""}
{"time": 1753682823, "type": "recv", "message_id": "68935598", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "头脚和拳壳都被折断，腹部的鳞片被剥下大部，随后被金属重剑摧毁了大半内脏，此刻腹腔内全是混乱的血污。背壳上有些伤痕，不过大体腕豪"}
{"time": 1753683002, "type": "recv", "message_id": "934199670", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（完好）"}
